# Copy to .dev.vars (git-ignored) for `npm run dev`. Deployed: `wrangler secret put <NAME>`.
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# Optional: route OpenAI calls through Cloudflare AI Gateway.
# AI_GATEWAY_URL=https://gateway.ai.cloudflare.com/v1/<account_id>/<gateway_id>/openai
# CF_AIG_TOKEN=...
# The fit container's origin is not a var: it is the KV key upstream:solver (binding CONFIG).
# Local dev (wrangler dev uses a local KV store): point it at the docker compose fit container once with
#   npx wrangler kv key put --binding CONFIG "upstream:solver" "http://127.0.0.1:8001" --local
# Deployed: infra/up.sh writes it. An unset key is an error that names this command.
